gth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," modifier. You or your mount still can make a regular attack at the end of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mounted Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mounted_Charge"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You can use this feat if either you or your mount has taken it. Mounts with this feat do not require the prerequisite.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
